gitrl-z (0.2.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Drop the libdazzle build dependency. It was used for a single helper, a
    Pango font description to CSS conversion, now reimplemented locally.
    libdazzle is no longer in the Ubuntu archive as of 26.04, so removing it
    lets the package build there.

